    "sentence_translations": [
      "Why can't I be your boyfriend?",
      "",
      "Little Ming likes Xiao Xiao.",
      "Today he confessed his feelings to her, but was refused.",
      "",
      "Little Ming asked:",
      "“Why? Why can't I be your boyfriend? Am I not good looking enough? Can good looks put food on the table?”",
      "",
      "Xiao Xiao replied: “You're wrong! Girls don't search for good looks in a boyfriend, they search for someone they like.”",
      "",
      "Little Ming had no choice but to ask: “So tell me, what type do you like?”",
      "",
      "Xiao Xiao replied: “I like good looking guys!”"
    ]
